          "text": "Témoignages: [D83] de WINTZENHEIM (68) vers COLMAR (68) 21.08.2021",
          "text_sha256": "b89c5c3b637b3a2a490b10ca0ebebecc1e0f17594e0a27af40e0a7ca93841a82"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
